 "_comment_registries": "LXM-REQ-000253: registries hold facts (formats, actors, hosts, vocabulary, thresholds, ratchet baselines) and are knowledge: they change only through the gate (kind: registry) and are part of the knowledge and state digests. items: how a canonical file splits into separately versioned items (an item starts at a line matching its pattern; the text before the first item, and every other file, is one item named by its path). classify: every file in the Master is canonical, derived, a registry, code, a document or inside an area; anything else fails the single-entry check.",
